d pre-built page templates you can fork per client.","keywords":"next.js template, indiecrafts, config-first, modular website","faq":[{"question":"Do I need to touch code to rebrand?","answer":"No. Point the config at your brand — name, colors, logo, languages — and the whole site follows. You only write code to add new sections or logic."},{"question":"How does adding a language work?","answer":"Add one row to the locale config and drop in a translations file. URLs, SEO, the sitemap, and the language switcher all update on their own."},{"question":"Is it SEO-ready out of the box?","answer":"Yes. Titles, descriptions, canonical URLs, hreflang, Open Graph, and JSON-LD — including this FAQ's rich-result markup — are generated from your content."},{"question":"Can I turn features off?","answer":"Every surface — blog, legal page, RSS, LLM endpoints, this FAQ — is a single flag. Flip it off and its routes, links, and sitemap entries disappear together."}],"hero":{"eyebrow":"Config-first template","title":"Ship client websites in a weekend","subtitle":"A modular Next.js foundation with i18n, SEO, a11y and Tailwind wired up — edit config, not code."},"blocks":{"features":{"title":"Built to cover your needs","body":"Extensive customization, full control, and AI-assisted workflows — in one tidy package.","items":{"customizable":{"title":"Customizable","body":"Extensive customization options, allowing you to tailor every aspect to meet your specific needs."},"fullControl":{"title":"You have full control","body":"From design elements to functionality, complete control to create a unique and personalized experience."},"poweredByAi":{"title":"Powered by AI","body":"Smart defaults, intelligent suggestions, and automated workflows built on modern AI primitives."}}},"cta":{"title":"Start Building","body":"Drop your email — we'll send you the first steps.","emailPlaceholder":"Your email address","submit":"Get started"},"pricing":{"title":"Pricing that scales with you","body":"Start 